{"t":"AI","made":"2026-11-24 14:32","name":"C3.ai, Inc.","ko":null,"sector":"Technology","industry":"Software - Infrastructure","employees":764,"hq":"Redwood City, CA, United States","website":"https://www.c3.ai","summary_en":"C3.ai, Inc. operates as an enterprise artificial intelligence application software company in North America, Europe, the Middle East, Africa, the Asia Pacific, and internationally. It offers C3 agentic AI platform, an application development and runtime environment that enables customers to design, develop, and deploy enterprise AI applications; C3 AI Studio, an integrated development environment in the C3 Agentic AI Platform that enables engineers, data scientists, and business analysts to design, build, test, and deploy AI applications; C3 AI Applications, a portfolio of industry-specific enterprise AI applications that enables the digital transformation of organizations globally; and C3 Generative AI, a library of agentic AI applications to retrieve data, analyze information, surface insights, and orchestrate workflows. The company also provides C3 Code, a solution that enables users to build, configure, and deploy a complete and production-grade Enterprise AI applications automatically, including data pipelines, AI models, business logic, security controls, and user interfaces. It has strategic partnerships with Microsoft, AWS, Google Cloud, McKinsey & Company, and Baker Hughes. The company was formerly known as C3 IoT, Inc. and changed its name to C3.ai, Inc. in June 2019. C3.ai, Inc. was incorporated in 2009 and is headquartered in Redwood City, California.","quote_type":"EQUITY","summary_ko":"C3.ai, Inc.는 북미, 유럽, 중동, 아프리카, 아시아 태평양 및 국제적으로 엔터프라이즈 인공 지능 응용 소프트웨어 회사로 운영되고 있습니다. 고객이 엔터프라이즈 AI 애플리케이션을 설계, 개발 및 배포할 수 있는 애플리케이션 개발 및 런타임 환경인 C3 에이전트 AI 플랫폼을 제공합니다. 엔지니어, 데이터 과학자 및 비즈니스 분석가가 AI 애플리케이션을 설계, 구축, 테스트 및 배포할 수 있도록 지원하는 C3 Agentic AI 플랫폼의 통합 개발 환경인 C3 AI Studio 전 세계적으로 조직의 디지털 혁신을 가능하게 하는 산업별 엔터프라이즈 AI 애플리케이션 포트폴리오인 C3 AI 애플리케이션 C3 Generative AI는 데이터 검색, 정보 분석, 통찰력 표면화 및 워크플로 조정을 위한 에이전트 AI 애플리케이션 라이브러리입니다. 또한 이 회사는 사용자가 데이터 파이프라인, AI 모델, 비즈니스 로직, 보안 제어 및 사용자 인터페이스를 포함하여 완전한 프로덕션급 엔터프라이즈 AI 애플리케이션을 자동으로 구축, 구성 및 배포할 수 있는 솔루션인 C3 Code를 제공합니다. Microsoft, AWS, Google Cloud, McKinsey & Company, Baker Hughes와 전략적 파트너십을 맺고 있습니다. 이 회사는 이전에 C3 IoT, Inc.로 알려졌으며 2019년 6월에 C3.ai, Inc.로 이름을 변경했습니다. C3.ai, Inc.는 2009년에 법인화되었으며 캘리포니아주 레드우드 시티에 본사를 두고 있습니다.","val":{"price":9.96,"mcap":1601367424.0,"pe":null,"fpe":-21.182476,"peg":null,"ps":6.8910995,"pb":2.2907083,"ev_ebitda":-2.259,"div":0.0,"beta":2.132,"hi52":16.4,"lo52":7.675},"fin":{"rev":232382000.0,"rev_g":-0.255,"eps_g":null,"gross":0.29093,"op":-1.98131,"net":-1.9210299,"roe":-0.59771997,"fcf":15887875.0,"cash":651068992.0,"debt":59465000.0,"de":8.557,"eps":-3.08,"feps":-0.4702},"own":{"short":0.2842,"inst":0.69336,"insider":0.08217},"analyst":{"n":10,"mean":8.9,"median":7.5,"high":16.0,"low":6.0,"rec":"underperform","recMean":3.53846,"trend":[{"index":0,"period":"0m","strongBuy":0,"buy":1,"hold":6,"sell":3,"strongSell":3},{"index":1,"period":"-1m","strongBuy":0,"buy":1,"hold":6,"sell":3,"strongSell":3},{"index":2,"period":"-2m","strongBuy":0,"buy":0,"hold":7,"sell":3,"strongSell":3},{"index":3,"period":"-3m","strongBuy":0,"buy":1,"hold":7,"sell":3,"strongSell":3}]},"changes":[{"GradeDate":"2026-10-12","Firm":"Northland Capital Markets","ToGrade":"Outperform","FromGrade":"Market Perform","Action":"up","priceTargetAction":"Raises","currentPriceTarget":16.0,"priorPriceTarget":10.0},{"GradeDate":"2026-10-02","Firm":"Citizens","ToGrade":"Market Perform","FromGrade":"Market Perform","Action":"reit","priceTargetAction":"","currentPriceTarget":0.0,"priorPriceTarget":0.0},{"GradeDate":"2026-09-29","Firm":"Citizens","ToGrade":"Market Perform","FromGrade":"Market Perform","Action":"reit","priceTargetAction":"","currentPriceTarget":0.0,"priorPriceTarget":0.0},{"GradeDate":"2026-09-03","Firm":"Citizens","ToGrade":"Market Perform","FromGrade":"Market Perform","Acti